    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Though Verrazano is by no means considered to be a great explorer, his name will probably remain immortal, for on November 21st, 1964, the longest suspension bridge in the world was named after him.",
      "translation": "虽然维拉扎诺绝不被认为是一个伟大的探险家，但他的名字可能会名垂青史，因为在1964年11月21日，世界上最大的悬索桥以他的名字命名。",
      "startTime": 39.43,
      "endTime": 59.31,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "immortal",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "不朽的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
